          </span>
          <span class="byline">Siobh&aacute;n Carrick</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 items-baseline justify-between py-4">
          <span class="grid gap-0.5">
            <span class="font-bold text-ink text-lg">Second System</span>
            <span class="text-muted text-sm">Rewrites that worked, and the ones that did not</span>
          </span>
          <span class="byline">Tomas Lindqvist</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-6 text-center byline">Your paper stays unlisted until you list it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story 05 · The stone: what is going out this week -->
  <section id="queue" class="mx-auto px-6 py-16 sm:py-20 max-w-[1400px]">
    <div class="grid gap-10 items-center lg:gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,7fr)_minmax(0,5fr)]">
      <figure class="order-2 m-0 lg:order-1 reveal">
        <div class="bg-panel border-2 border-ink" role="img" aria-label="The schedule showing three queued stories, one currently going out">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-ink" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="text-on-accent folio">The schedule</span>
            <span class="text-on-accent folio">This week</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="divide-line divide-y">
            <QueueRow slot="Mon 09:00" body="New issue: what shipping every Friday for a year cost me." icons="bluesky,x,mastodon" status="published" />
            <QueueRow slot="Wed 13:30" body="The paragraph everyone replied to, on its own." icons="linkedin,threads" status="publishing" />
            <QueueRow slot="Fri 18:00" body="Paying subscribers get the full ledger this weekend." icons="instagram,x" status="scheduled" />
          </ul>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-2 byline">Three slots, six networks, one draft each.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 max-w-md reveal">
        <SectionLabel index="04" label="Distribution" />
        <h2 class="mt-3 leading-[1.02] text-4xl text-ink sm:text-5xl">Every network,<br>from one draft.</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 rule-thin"></div>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-body copy">Announce the issue, queue the follow-ups, and let each network get wording that fits it. Publishing the piece is where the sequence starts, not another chore after it.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 border-line border-t divide-line divide-y">
          <li class="flex gap-3 items-center py-3"><span class="grid place-items-center shrink-0 h-6 w-6 text-ink border border-ink folio">1</span><span class="text-body text-sm">Six networks from one composer</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3 items-center py-3"><span class="grid place-items-center shrink-0 h-6 w-6 text-ink border border-ink folio">2</span><span class="text-body text-sm">Per-network limits and previews</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3 items-center py-3"><span class="grid place-items-center shrink-0 h-6 w-6 text-ink border border-ink folio">3</span><span class="text-body text-sm">Schedule ahead or put it out now</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The EXTRA banner: the one reversed beat on the sheet -->
  <section class="text-on-accent bg-ink" aria-label="Open source and owned">
    <div class="mx-auto px-6 py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-[1400px]">
